---
accTitle: One root turn, end to end
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Desktop app
    participant H as ChildHost
    participant L as Agent loop
    participant P as Provider ACL
    participant T as Tools over ACLs

    U->>A: message
    A->>H: root-turn envelope
    H->>L: send-message command
    loop until the model answers without tool calls
        L->>P: ModelRequest (streaming)
        P-->>L: deltas, then the full response
        L->>T: dispatch tool calls
        T-->>L: ToolResult, or Error [CODE]
    end
    L-->>H: turn settled
    H-->>A: streamed events + settle
    A-->>U: rendered transcript
